# WCPOS Product Naming

Use the short product names in all customer-facing app translation strings.

| Correct | Incorrect |
| --- | --- |
| WCPOS | WooCommerce POS |
| WCPOS Pro | WooCommerce POS Pro |

## Rules

- Preserve `WCPOS`, `WCPOS Pro`, `WooCommerce`, and `WordPress` exactly as product/brand names.
- Do not translate `WCPOS` or `WCPOS Pro`.
- Replace customer-facing `WooCommerce POS` with `WCPOS`.
- Replace customer-facing `WooCommerce POS Pro` with `WCPOS Pro`.
- Do not change technical identifiers, slugs, repository names, filenames, or URLs that contain `woocommerce-pos` or `woocommerce-pos-pro`.
- Do not change existing code-style identifiers such as `wcposVersion`, `wcposProVersion`, `X-WCPOS-Idempotency-Key`, or namespace/package names.

## Examples

- ✅ `Please update your WCPOS plugin.`
- ❌ `Please update your WooCommerce POS plugin.`
- ✅ `Upgrade to WCPOS Pro.`
- ❌ `Upgrade to WooCommerce POS Pro.`
- ✅ Keep slug/file identifiers such as `woocommerce-pos-de_DE.po` unchanged.
